    ('fert', 'Ф', 22, 'Фертъ', 'The letter F', 'Фертъ is a sign of the Old Slavonic alphabet. Its meaning: The letter F. These letters preserved sound, numerical memory, and the book tradition of early church writing.', NULL, 'Ф', '#1f3f66', '', '', '', '', 'en', 'd4a07344-be25-43ec-a499-f42fddaa8868', 'published'),
